OL,8,G0232 Health Check
OL,9,     FThree months since the outbreak
OL,10,     Fwas declared more than 1,900
OL,11,     Fpeople have died from the virus,
OL,12,     Fwith more than 4200 confirmed
OL,13,     Fcases, making this the
OL,14,     Fsecond-worst Ebola outbreak ever.
